A1 点名一条只跑第一段（对照）
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 12 --skip-stage-two
    分类: None
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=1 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=True two_only=False threads=31 memory_cap=24G
A2 点名 5091 条只跑第一段
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 1 --item 2 --item 3 --item 4 --item 5 -- …（共 60044 字）… --item 5090 --item 5091 --skip-stage-two
    分类: None
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=5091 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=True two_only=False threads=31 memory_cap=24G
A3 A2 带前缀（驱动要它）
    命令: SINGLEFS_HEAVY_TESTS=user-request nice -n 19 python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py -- …（共 60089 字）… --item 5090 --item 5091 --skip-stage-two
    分类: None
A4 点名 + 只跑第一段 + 放大线程与内存
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 1 --skip-stage-two --threads 64 --memory-cap 200G
    分类: None
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=1 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=True two_only=False threads=64 memory_cap=200G
A5 假步驱动写真库
    命令: BROAD_MUTATION_STEP_DRIVER=/bin/true python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 7 --skip-stage-two
    分类: None
A6 弄坏开关进真跑
    命令: BROAD_MUTATION_BREAK=interrupted-as-done python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 7 --skip-stage-two
    分类: None
B1 --summary 加 --shard
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --summary --shard 0/2
    分类: None
    驱动: 只列项/汇总后返回
B2 --sync-tree 加 --shard
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --sync-tree --shard 0/2
    分类: None
    驱动: 只 sync_tree(commit=HEAD) 后返回
B3 --sync-tree 换提交
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --sync-tree --commit HEAD~1
    分类: None
    驱动: 只 sync_tree(commit=HEAD~1) 后返回
B4 --list-items 加 --from
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --list-items --from 1
    分类: None
    驱动: 只列项/汇总后返回
B5 -h 在后面
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --shard 0/2 -h
    分类: None
B6 --summary 当 --home 的值
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --home --summary
    分类: None
    驱动: argparse 退 2
B7 -- 之后的 --summary
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --shard 0/2 -- --summary
    分类: None
    驱动: argparse 退 2
B8 两段开关并用
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 1 --skip-stage-two --stage-two-only
    分类: None
    驱动: argparse 退 2
B9 --item 加 --stage-two-only
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 1 --stage-two-only
    分类: broad-mutation
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=1 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=False two_only=True threads=31 memory_cap=24G
B10 缩写 --skip（argparse 认前缀）
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item 1 --skip
    分类: broad-mutation
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=1 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=True two_only=False threads=31 memory_cap=24G
B11 缩写 --list
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --list
    分类: broad-mutation
    驱动: 只列项/汇总后返回
B12 缩写 --sum
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --sum
    分类: broad-mutation
    驱动: 只列项/汇总后返回
B13 --item=1 贴着写
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --item=1 --skip-stage-two
    分类: broad-mutation
    驱动: 真跑 run_items：item=1 条 from=None package=None shard=None skip_two=True two_only=False threads=31 memory_cap=24G
C1 bash -c
    命令: bash -c 'python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --shard 0/2'
    分类: broad-mutation
C2 env
    命令: env X=1 python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C3 nice + 绝对路径
    命令: nice -n 19 python3 /home/fy5090/code/singlefs/research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C4 cd 进去相对路径
    命令: cd research/scripts && python3 ./broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C5 直接执行（有执行位）
    命令: ./research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --shard 1/2
    分类: broad-mutation
C6 python3 -u
    命令: python3 -u research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C7 python3 -W ignore（带值的解释器选项）
    命令: python3 -W ignore research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --shard 0/2
    分类: None
C8 python3 -X dev
    命令: python3 -X dev research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
C9 python3 -c runpy
    命令: python3 -c "import runpy; runpy.run_path('research/scripts/broad-mutation.py', run_name='__main__')" --shard 0/2
    分类: None
C10 python3 -c exec
    命令: python3 -c "__file__='research/scripts/broad-mutation.py'; exec(open(__file__).read())"
    分类: None
C11 python3 - < 脚本
    命令: python3 - --shard 0/2 < research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
C12 符号链接
    命令: ln -s broad-mutation.py research/scripts/bm.py && python3 research/scripts/bm.py
    分类: None
C13 仓内改名拷贝
    命令: cp research/scripts/broad-mutation.py research/scripts/bm2.py && python3 research/scripts/bm2.py
    分类: None
C14 变量间接
    命令: S=research/scripts/broad-mutation.py; python3 $S
    分类: None
C15 python3.12 全路径
    命令: /usr/bin/python3.12 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C16 多余斜杠与 ..
    命令: python3 research//scripts/../scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C17 capped.sh 包一层
    命令: bash research/scripts/capped.sh 31 python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C18 run-with-memory-cap 包一层
    命令: bash research/scripts/run-with-memory-cap.sh 24G python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C19 xargs
    命令: echo --shard 0/2 | xargs python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
C20 setsid / stdbuf
    命令: stdbuf -oL python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C21 command / exec
    命令: exec python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C22 前一条放过、后一条整趟
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --summary; python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: broad-mutation
C23 pypy3 / uv run
    命令: uv run research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
D1 T2 py_compile 语法检查
    命令: python3 -m py_compile research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
D2 T2 grep 读它
    命令: grep -n main research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
D3 T2 sha256sum
    命令: sha256sum research/scripts/broad-mutation.py
    分类: None
D4 T2 草稿目录的仓副本里起（路径尾是 research/scripts）
    命令: python3 /tmp/claude-1000/some-leg/copy/research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --home /tmp/claude-1000/some-leg/home
    分类: broad-mutation
D5 T2 主 agent 全量
    命令: SINGLEFS_HEAVY_TESTS=user-request nice -n 19 python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --threads 31
    分类: broad-mutation
D6 T2 --selftest
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --selftest
    分类: commit-check-selftest
D7 T2 --selftest 混运行参数
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --selftest --shard 0/2
    分类: commit-check-selftest
    驱动: 走 --selftest
D8 T2 --stage-two-only 全量
    命令: python3 research/scripts/broad-mutation.py --stage-two-only
    分类: broad-mutation
